        "Description": "Good morning 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Dr. Katashi Ito, a an organ trafficer working as a doctor for the &apos;Gama&apos; hospital in Hokkaido, Japan.\rOur client, &apos;Interpol&apos;, has been investigating him fora long time now, but the investigation stopped when their agent got kidnapped.\rIn addition, the client has tasked us to free Carlton Smith, the kidnapped agent.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
